# TALYX — what does NOT go to GitHub
#
# The AI folder is ~7.7 GB. GitHub rejects files over 100 MB and a repo this size is
# unusable. Only the SYSTEM travels: code, docs, measured profiles, ledgers.
# Media stays local and moves by other means (Drive, or regenerate it).

# ---- render intermediates: fully regenerable ----
work/_*_tmp/
work/intermediate/
work/quarantine/
work/projects/*/tmp/
*.frames/

# ---- big media banks ----
assets/broll/
assets/sfx/
assets/bgm/inbox/
assets/bgm/utility-beds/
assets/bgm/mixkit/
assets/shared/stems/

# ---- reference videos: 186 MB. The MEASURED PROFILES derived from them ARE tracked,
#      so the numbers survive even though the source videos don't.
assets/pillars/*/refs/*.mp4
assets/pillars/*/refs/*.mov
assets/pillars/*/refs/*.webm

# ---- Whisper weights: 280 MB, re-downloadable ----
models/

# ---- generated + source video ----
output/*.mp4
work/*.mp4
work/*.wav
work/*.png
RESTORE/

# ---- persona photos: personal, and large ----
assets/nev/

# ---- but DO keep these, they are small and they are the point ----
!assets/pillars/**/*.md
!assets/pillars/**/*.json
!assets/pillars/*/plates/*.png
!work/ledgers/*.json
!work/plans/*.md
!work/qc/*.png

# ---- housekeeping ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.spec
ffmpeg-extracted/
*.zip
work/last-run.txt
work/last-import.txt
